            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Codex Whip 1.8.1

A quiet heads-up when a new version is ready.

• A new update is available… appears at the top of the menu with an orange dot.
• Click the notice to review the update and choose when to install.
• With Automatic Updates off, quiet daily checks stay on while new updates wait for your choice.
• Existing preferences migrate once without enabling automatic downloads.

Your retry settings, session state, history, app identity and update-verification key are preserved.

macOS 14 or later. This community build is ad hoc signed and is not Apple-notarized.
]]></description>
